<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56 (FIM 257.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56 (FIM 257.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $1-3/8 to end at $56 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 257.90 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed down 7.00 markka at 261.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded on Wall Street on Wednesday. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 2.00 at 80.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was also untraded in New York on Wednesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 1.00 at 89.00 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
